       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.        TOEMCOPY.
       AUTHOR.            CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.      OCTOBER 2000.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.      THE GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *D   T O E M C O P Y                                             *
      *D                                                               *
      *D     THIS PROGRAM COPIES RECORDS FROM MCFPCSOEM TO MCFPCSMANF  *
      *D     FOR UPDATE.                                               *
      *D                                                               *
      ******************************************************************
      *  C H A N G E S :                                               *
      *                                                                *
      *C                                                               *
      ******************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.     IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.     IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MANUF-IO
               ASSIGN        TO DATABASE-MCFLCSMNF1
               ORGANIZATION  IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE   IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY    IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                                WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS   IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT OEM-I
               ASSIGN        TO DATABASE-MCFLCSOEM1
               ORGANIZATION  IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE   IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY    IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                                WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS   IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MANUF-IO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MANUF-REC-IO.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCSMNF1.

       FD  OEM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  OEM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCSOEM   OF MCFLCSOEM1.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  NUM-RECS               PIC 9(4)  VALUE 0.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *             D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       COPY MANFFILE IN COPYLIB.

       COPY OEMFILE  IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                    H O L D   A R E A S                         *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X    VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X    VALUE "0".

       01  OEM-EOF-SW                    PIC X    VALUE "N".

       01  HOLD-INDATE.
           05  HOLD-CC                   PIC X(2)   VALUE "20".
           05  HOLD-DATE                 PIC X(6).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *               U T I L I T Y   A R E A                          *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB      IN COPYLIB.


      *--------- P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N ------------------*

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAINLINE SECTION.
       0-MAINLINE-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN  INPUT OEM-I
                   I-O MANUF-IO.

           ACCEPT HOLD-DATE FROM DATE.

       2-EOJ.
           DISPLAY "NUMBER OF RECORDS COPIED:  " NUM-RECS.

           CLOSE       MANUF-IO
                       OEM-I.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *               M A I N   P A R A G R A P H                      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       6-MAIN.

           PERFORM 9999-START-OEMFILE.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-OEMFILE.
           PERFORM 60-COPY-RECS UNTIL OEM-EOF-SW = "Y".

       60-COPY-RECS.
           INITIALIZE BUF-MNFFILE.
           MOVE OEM-CORP-CODE      TO  MNF-CORP-CODE.
           MOVE HOLD-INDATE        TO  MNF-IN-DATE.
           MOVE "O"                TO  MNF-TYPE.
           WRITE MANUF-REC-IO FROM BUF-MNFFILE.
           ADD 1                   TO  NUM-RECS.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-OEMFILE.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *               U T I L I T Y   S E C T I O N                    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       9999-UTILITY SECTION.

       9999-START-OEMFILE.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO CORPCDE OF OEM-REC-I.
           START OEM-I KEY > CORPCDE OF OEM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-READ-NEXT-OEMFILE.
           READ OEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-OEMFILE
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO OEM-EOF-SW.

